<title>ITALY: CYCLING-GIRO D'ITALIA 13TH STAGE PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-GIRO D'ITALIA 13TH STAGE PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>CUNEO, Italy 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>150-km 13th stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race from Varazze</p>
<p>on Friday:</p>
<p>1. Glenn Magnusson (Sweden) Amore &amp; Vita  3 hours 25 minutes</p>
<p>and four seconds</p>
<p>  2. Mirko Rossato (Italy) Scrigno	     one second behind</p>
<p>3. Mario Cipollini (Italy) Saeco</p>
<p>4. Mario Traversoni (Italy) Mercatone Uno</p>
<p>5. Fabio Baldato (Italy) Maglificio MG</p>
